OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start, with cloud and
OL,6,Frain gradually clearing eastwards to
OL,7,Fleave a bright and sunny afternoon.
OL,8,FFeeling noticeably cooler in a
OL,9,Fmoderate northerly breeze, with rather
OL,10,Fgusty conditions across the far
OL,11,Fsouthwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA few, scattered showers
OL,14,Faround. These remaining light and
OL,15,Ffading through the early hours.
OL,16,FOtherwise, clear spells. Winds easing
OL,17,Fovernight, feeling chillier than last
OL,18,Fnight, particularly along southern
OL,19,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
