OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA bright start for most,
OL,6,Fturning increasingly cloudy from the
OL,7,Fwest with rain to follow in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Feeling markedly cooler
OL,9,Fthan Wednesday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloud
OL,12,Fthickening into Friday with outbreaks
OL,13,Fof rain, heavy at times with blustery
OL,14,Fwinds. Rain clearing into Saturday
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells and showers to
OL,16,Ffollow. More settled on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
